ative but jon had plenty of gravel  and it was a very cheap business to run  soon enough sean made his business  official by registering it as sean queen  tourist limited over time he expanded  into selling other construction  materials as well but by far his biggest  jump forward was when he started selling  cement which would become the basis of  his fortune as this meant business  started to pick up steam sean entered  some more difficult industries such as  glass and plastics sean opened up loads  of subsidiaries throughout the 1970s and  80s but all of them were concentrated on  construction you see sean was able to  build up a substantial number of  construction contracts through the  gaelic athletic association which is a  group focused on promoting irish  sporting and culture sean felt  comfortable dealing with members of this  group and for decades he avoided  venturing into anything else but  eventually in the 1990s sean would take  his first steps outside of construction  sean didn't just jump into starting a  tech company or investing into crypto  though in terms of diversification sean  looked for industries that had similar  stability and consistency to  construction which led him to finance in  1996 sean founded quinn financial  services which offered a variety of  different financial services but their  most popular business was insurance this  probably had to do with the fact that  sean was extremely popular within  northern ireland though his wealth had  skyrocketed from zero to hundreds of  millions over the past few decades to  most people who actually knew sean he  was just another hard-working irishman  sure he had nice houses and cars but he  never lost his connection to the  everyday man  in fact he was constantly building up  his relationship with this community  instead of bringing in highly educated  people from the us and europe shawn  preferred to employ as many local people  as he could  at its peak sean employed 8 000 people 5  500 of 